const s=(t,n="datetime")=>{if(!t)return"";const o=typeof t=="number"&&t<9999999999?t*1e3:Number(t),e=new Date(o);if(isNaN(e.getTime()))return"";const r=String(e.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,"0"),a=String(e.getDate()).padStart(2,"0"),i=String(e.getHours()).padStart(2,"0"),u=String(e.getMinutes()).padStart(2,"0");return n==="date"?`${r}/${a}`:n==="time"?`${i}:${u}`:`${r}/${a} ${i}:${u}`};export{s as u};
